[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the\nramp.</p><p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3025360\">4450B04</a> .</p><p>Proceed with the removal <a href=\"#/3025916\">7055B64</a> (Right\nside).</p>"],[30,63,0,"<p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a> .</p>"],[30,63,0,"<p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3025319\">4410A80</a> .</p><p>1. Unscrew the bolts securing the right drive shaft to the intermediate\ndrive shaft.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004106.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[30,63,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the intermediate drive shaft (1b).</p><p>Remove the dust excluder.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004107.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Refit the intermediate drive shaft (1a) in its seating complete\nwith dust excluder and tighten its bolts (1b) to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004108.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Tighten the bolts securing the right drive shaft to the intermediate\ndrive shaft to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004109.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting <a href=\"#/3025319\">4410A80</a> .</p>"],[30,63,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting <a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a> .</p>"],[30,63,0,"<p>Proceed with the refitting \n<a href=\"#/3025916\">7055B64</a> (Right side).</p><p>Proceed with the refitting <a href=\"#/3025360\">4450B04</a> (Right side).</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]